IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `plr-rules`

-- Public and Educational Lending Rights (Better Income for Authors) Act 2026
-- (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`author` MEANS `author of the whole or a part`

GIVEN r IS A `Residence`, k IS A `Contribution`, pk IS A `Publisher kind`
GIVETH A `Lending case`
`a person who is` r `and` k `publishing as` pk MEANS
    `Lending case` OF r, TRUE, k, pk, `a delegate of the Secretary`, Date 1 3 2028, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING

GIVEN rec IS A MAYBE DATE, notif IS A MAYBE DATE, longer IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Lending case`
`a review with request received` rec `notified` notif `longer period` longer MEANS
    `Lending case` OF `an Australian citizen`, TRUE, `author`, `not a publisher`, `a delegate of the Secretary`, Date 1 3 2028, longer, rec, notif, NOTHING

-- s 5
#ASSERT `I am an Australian creator` (`a person who is` `an Australian citizen` `and` `author` `publishing as` `not a publisher`)
#ASSERT `I am an Australian creator` (`a person who is` `a permanent resident of Australia` `and` `illustrator or translator of the whole or a part` `publishing as` `not a publisher`)
#ASSERT NOT (`I am an Australian creator` (`a person who is` `neither` `and` `author` `publishing as` `not a publisher`))
#ASSERT NOT (`I am an Australian creator` (`a person who is` `an Australian citizen` `and` `none of these` `publishing as` `not a publisher`))
#ASSERT `I am an Australian publisher` (`a person who is` `an Australian citizen` `and` `author` `publishing as` `an Australian creator who also publishes the book in Australia`)
#ASSERT NOT (`I am an Australian publisher` (`a person who is` `neither` `and` `author` `publishing as` `an Australian creator who also publishes the book in Australia`))
#ASSERT `I am an Australian publisher` (`a person who is` `neither` `and` `none of these` `publishing as` `a company incorporated in Australia publishing books in Australia`)
-- s 33(2): notified 1 March 2028, request by 28 March 2028.
#ASSERT `the last request day for` (`a review with request received` NOTHING `notified` NOTHING `longer period` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 28 3 2028)
#ASSERT `the last request day for` (`a review with request received` NOTHING `notified` NOTHING `longer period` (JUST (Date 30 4 2028))) EQUALS JUST (Date 30 4 2028)
-- s 33(5): received 10 March 2028, decide by 7 June 2028.
#ASSERT `the last reconsideration day for` (`a review with request received` (JUST (Date 10 3 2028)) `notified` NOTHING `longer period` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 7 6 2028)
-- s 33(8)
#ASSERT `the decision is taken to be affirmed` (`a review with request received` (JUST (Date 10 3 2028)) `notified` NOTHING `longer period` NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the decision is taken to be affirmed` (`a review with request received` (JUST (Date 10 3 2028)) `notified` (JUST (Date 8 6 2028)) `longer period` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT (`the decision is taken to be affirmed` (`a review with request received` (JUST (Date 10 3 2028)) `notified` (JUST (Date 7 6 2028)) `longer period` NOTHING))
-- s 34
#ASSERT `I may apply to the Tribunal` (`a review with request received` (JUST (Date 10 3 2028)) `notified` (JUST (Date 7 6 2028)) `longer period` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT (`I may apply to the Tribunal` (`a review with request received` NOTHING `notified` NOTHING `longer period` NOTHING))
#ASSERT `I may apply to the Tribunal` (`Lending case` OF `an Australian citizen`, TRUE, `author`, `not a publisher`, `the Secretary personally`, Date 1 3 2028, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING)
-- s 38(2)(c)
#ASSERT `the earliest notice end for` (`Lending case` OF `an Australian citizen`, TRUE, `author`, `not a publisher`, `the Secretary personally`, Date 1 3 2028, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, JUST (Date 1 7 2028)) EQUALS JUST (Date 28 7 2028)
